abstract: >-
  A reproducible educational copper electrokinetic reactive transport calculation
  with a closed saturated column, conservative transport, simultaneous chemical
  equilibrium, retained refinement runs, and verification diagnostics. It demonstrates
  redistribution and phase transfer and is not experimentally validated.
keywords:
  - electrokinetic reactive transport
  - Nernst-Planck
  - copper
  - numerical verification
